    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23732" root="صبن" body-key="S">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصطبن</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انصبن</span></b>  (K, TA) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَبْيَنَ</span></b> 
(so in my MS. copy of the K) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيْبَنَ</span></b>  (so in
the CK, but neither of these is in the TA,) <i>He,</i>
or <i>it, turned away</i> or <i>back,</i> or <i>became turned
away</i> or <i>back.</i> (K.)

